      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Well, we know tha AVPro itself supports audio filters just fine, so I guess its something about how VRC has it set up, which is unfortunate.\nI double checked using the AVPro trial and it played through audio filters via the provided Audio Output component and with the Windows-specific settings set to Unity Audio.\nhttps://streamable.com/fyzreb",
      "viewerReactions": null
