      "value": "@{5fa30b66b36d4b12af626dc8|full_name}: ok, that's fair, altho i just tested this shitty code for adding at runtime, and it seems like just moving it up and toggling the effects on and off on the same frame - makes it re-apply them\nBut i guess you can't just shove an internal method without some hacky solutions :thinking: Thanks for details tho! At least it helps to understand what's going on :P",
      "viewerReactions": null
